yle=\"display: none;\">...</span></div></header><!-- .entry-header --><div class=\"entry-content\"><p><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/open?id=1sfVlZzI1JpiiplM-yxZZb6NDcuP9j8I3\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-26825\" src=\"https://estranhosidade.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/file.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"474\" height=\"264\" /></a></p>\n<div>\n<p>• <em>“I wasn&#8217;t born who I was meant to be, and it cost me a lot.”</em> – <a href=\"http://web.archive.org/web/20191230084152/https://www.imdb.com/title/tt8919312/\">Mr Robot &#8211; eXit</a></p>\n<p>• Obrigado por tudo e me desculpa. Por favor, me perdoe.</p>\n<p>• Acredito que pelo menos uns 90% dos problemas do Brasil se deve ao judiciário.</p>\n<p>• Maybe when you die you see everything, you get the answer to every question in the whole universe, you finally get it all and see with clarity, see all those things that really matter for once in your life. A trillion lights and truths.</p>\n<p class=\"more-wrap\"><a href=\"2019-12-31-diario-31-12-2019.html#more-26824\" class=\"more-link\">Continue lendo <span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Diário: 31/12/2019</span> <span class=\"meta-nav\">&rarr;</span></a></p></div></article>",
